// `directory/client.Write` with a Clearance only (ADR-0005 rule 2, O2), with that precondition;
// the connector repeats every check and performs the conditional write of ADR-0005 rule 4 only if
// the target is unchanged and not tier0. The connector keeps no plan state: Apply stands on its own.
//
